/* When the dock is closed in workbench mode, the fixed top-right dock-toggle
   overlaps the topic bar's right edge; leave room so the actions don't
   collide with it. When the dock is open it occupies the right column, so no
   extra margin is needed. Classic/creation keep the toggle inside the actions
   row, so the extra margin does not apply there. */
.layout--workbench:not(.layout--workspace-open) .topicbar__actions {
